# Machine-generated migration data. `convert` writes these with
# JSON.stringify(…, null, 2); prettier formats short arrays differently, so
# letting it reformat them on commit means every subsequent `pnpm convert`
# re-dirties the tree and the committed JSON stops being byte-reproducible.
# The pipeline owns this directory (ADR 0003) — prettier does not.
tools/migration/data/

# Captured prototypes (ADR 0010). Frozen third-party artifacts — reformatting
# one makes the committed file stop matching what was actually delivered, and
# the diff noise buries any real change to the set. Only the set directories;
# the story files and frame.tsx beside them are formatted normally.
apps/storybook/prototypes/*/

# Build output
**/.next/
**/storybook-static/
**/dist/
